{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:215d5b74e0085d21","name":"Cerean","source":{"id":"source:reference-215d5b74e0085d21","title":"Cerean","revision":18021,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:27:31Z","sha256":"cb49df005fc716b77f12f93bbb00ab06ee2b3d465b0a9a48c92896e6340401de","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18021","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Cerean&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-215d5b74e0085d21","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Cereans are a sophisticated and cultured humanoid Species native to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cerea"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cerea","referenceId":"reference:8bfd724ab0c8c7ba"},", a world on the fringes of known space. Their elongated heads distinguish them from most other humanoid ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},". Cereans established contact with the rest of the galaxy shortly before ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Republic","referenceId":"reference:332055cafc4223eb"}," was transformed into ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},", swiftly gaining fame as expert astrogators, cryptographers, and economists. Few patterns or trends escape the notice of a Cerean.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Cerean society is matriarchal, and the Cerean culture's traditional values emphasize living in harmony with nature and minimizing any impact on the environment from technology. The peaceful philosophies of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," appeal to Cereans, and many join the Order.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Cerean Characteristics"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Personality:"]}," Cereans tend to be calm, rational, and extremely logical.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Physical Description:"]}," Cerean males average at 2.0 meters tall and 78 kilograms, while a typical Cerean female stands at 1.8 meters tall and 58 kilograms. They have elongated craniums housing binary brains, and have a maturity rate and life span similar to those of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Humans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Humans"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Age Groups"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Age_Groups"},":"]}," Cereans age at the following stages:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHILD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["YOUNG ADULT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["ADULT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MIDDLE AGE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["OLD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["VENERABLE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1-10 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["11-15 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["16-35 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["36-53 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["54-64 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["65+ Years\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Homeworld:"]}," The blissful planet ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cerea"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cerea","referenceId":"reference:8bfd724ab0c8c7ba"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Cereans speak, read, and write both Cerean and Basic.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Example Names:"]}," Ki-Adi, So Leet, Sylvn, Ti-Dal, Maj-Odo.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Adventurers:"]}," Cereans who become adventurers do so in spite of their peaceful traditions. Still, when a cause or situation leads down this path, a Cerean tries to keep these traditions intact, avoiding aggression when possible. The binary brain allows a Cerean to constantly weigh both sides in any disagreement and give two points of view equal consideration. This ability extends even to issues surrounding ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", and a Cerean ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," often contemplates ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Light Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Light_Side"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," simultaneously.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Cerean Species Traits"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Cereans share the following Species Traits:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ability Modifiers:"]}," Cereans have a +2 bonus to both their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," and their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"},", but suffer a -2 penalty to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"},". Cereans are bright and intuitive but less coordinated than most other species."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Medium Size:"]}," As Medium creatures, Cereans have no special bonuses or penalties due to their size."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Cerean have a base speed of 6 squares."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Conditional Bonus Feat:"]}," A Cerean with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained_Skill"}," gains ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Focus (Initiative)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Focus_(Initiative)"}," as a bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Intuitive Initiative:"]}," Despite their general lack of coordination, Cereans' reaction speed is superior to that of most other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},". A Cerean may choose to reroll any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," check, but the result of the reroll must be accepted, even if it is worse."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Automatic Languages:"]}," All Cereans can speak, read, and write both Basic and Cerean."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Cerean Species Feats"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Cerean characters have access to the following ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species_Feats"},". No Species Feats are considered Bonus Feats for any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heroic Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heroic_Class"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SPECIES FEAT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["BENEFITS\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Binary Mind"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Binary_Mind","referenceId":"reference:8d756cee158c1476"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Enemies must roll twice, keeping the lower result, on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mind-Affecting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mind-Affecting"}," effects.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Mind of Reason"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mind_of_Reason","referenceId":"reference:bf7dbd11d93f2bc3"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," instead of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"},"-based ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Perfect Intuition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perfect_Intuition","referenceId":"reference:bb4106fc44cf60d7"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Reroll ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," checks, always keeping the better result.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
